IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ohsr-dates`
IMPORT `ohsr-core`
IMPORT `ohsr-seat`

-- Occupational Health and Safety Regulations 2017 (Vic) -- cases for the seat of the worker: reach (r 8), general
-- duties (rr 18-20), the orders of control and reviews, hazardous manual handling (Part 3.1), noise (Part 3.2), falls
-- (Part 3.3), confined spaces (Part 3.4), plant (Part 3.5) and penalties. Every expected value was worked by hand from
-- the deposited text (Version No. 018), with the regulation in the comment; none was copied from the encoding's output.
--
-- BASELINE. Not for public use as advice. See NOTES.md.

GIVEN `dd` IS A NUMBER
      `mm` IS A NUMBER
      `yy` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`day` `dd` `mm` `yy` MEANS DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY `dd` `mm` `yy`)

GIVEN `dd` IS A NUMBER
      `mm` IS A NUMBER
      `yy` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
`on` `dd` `mm` `yy` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY `dd` `mm` `yy`

-- r 8 (with s 21(3) of the Act). Inputs: employee, contractor, matter within control.
#ASSERT `Do the Regulations' employer duties reach me` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Do the Regulations' employer duties reach me` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Do the Regulations' employer duties reach me` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Do the Regulations' employer duties reach me` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- r 19(3): at the employer's expense only where the Regulations require it ("This regulation applies if").
#ASSERT `Must my employer pay for my health monitoring` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must my employer pay for my health monitoring` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- r 19. Inputs: required, told purpose and nature, charged.
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached r 19` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached r 19` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached r 19` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached r 19` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- r 20: the closed list of recipients.
#ASSERT `May my employer give my health report to this person` `the person the report is about` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `May my employer give my health report to this person` `a third party the person authorised in writing` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `May my employer give my health report to this person` `the Authority, on request or where these Regulations require` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `May my employer give my health report to this person` `anyone else` EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- r 18. Inputs: required by the Regulations, required by Part 5.2 or 5.3, properly installed, used and maintained.
#ASSERT `Was a required control measure not properly kept up` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Was a required control measure not properly kept up` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was a required control measure not properly kept up` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was a required control measure not properly kept up` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- The orders of control. Inputs: hazard, measure relied on, highest reasonably practicable, reduced so far as RP.
-- r 34(3)-(4): administrative controls where engineering controls were reasonably practicable.
#ASSERT `Did my employer break the order of control` `noise (r 34)` `administrative controls` `engineering controls` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Did my employer break the order of control` `noise (r 34)` `engineering controls` `engineering controls` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Did my employer break the order of control` `noise (r 34)` `engineering controls` `engineering controls` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- r 34(3)(a)-(b) share a rank: engineering controls where substitution was also reasonably practicable.
#ASSERT `Did my employer break the order of control` `noise (r 34)` `engineering controls` `substitution` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- r 44(1): eliminated.
#ASSERT `Did my employer break the order of control` `a fall of more than 2 metres (r 44)` `eliminating the risk` `a passive fall prevention device` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- r 44(4)-(5): a ladder where a fall arrest system was reasonably practicable.
#ASSERT `Did my employer break the order of control` `a fall of more than 2 metres (r 44)` `a ladder` `a fall arrest system` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- r 44(5)(a)-(b) share a rank.
#ASSERT `Did my employer break the order of control` `a fall of more than 2 metres (r 44)` `a ladder` `administrative controls` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- r 27(4): training relied on where mechanical aids were reasonably practicable.
#ASSERT `Did my employer break the order of control` `hazardous manual handling (r 27)` `information, instruction or training` `mechanical aids` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Did my employer break the order of control` `hazardous manual handling (r 27)` `information, instruction or training` `information, instruction or training` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- r 238(2)-(3): sealing where enclosing was reasonably practicable; enclosing where only sealing was.
#ASSERT `Did my employer break the order of control` `asbestos at the workplace (r 238)` `sealing the asbestos` `enclosing the asbestos` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Did my employer break the order of control` `asbestos at the workplace (r 238)` `enclosing the asbestos` `sealing the asbestos` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- r 163(4): protective equipment where isolation was reasonably practicable.
#ASSERT `Did my employer break the order of control` `a hazardous substance (r 163)` `personal protective equipment, including hearing protectors` `isolation` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- r 325: no measure at all.
#ASSERT `Did my employer break the order of control` `construction work (r 325)` `no measure` `administrative controls` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A "best" measure the Part does not name.
#ASSERT `Did my employer break the order of control` `noise (r 34)` `personal protective equipment, including hearing protectors` `a passive fall prevention device` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- r 56(2).
#ASSERT `Did my employer break the order of control` `work in a confined space (r 56)` `other measures that take the listed matters into account` `other measures that take the listed matters into account` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- r 98: a measure the plant order does not name.
#ASSERT `Did my employer break the order of control` `plant (r 98)` `mechanical aids` `substitution` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- Reviews (rr 28, 36, 48, 62, 164, 185, 239, 326).
#ASSERT `Must my employer review its controls` `hazardous manual handling (r 27)` `a musculoskeletal disorder was reported` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must my employer review its controls` `noise (r 34)` `a musculoskeletal disorder was reported` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must my employer review its controls` `noise (r 34)` `an audiological report found hearing loss likely due to noise` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must my employer review its controls` `work in a confined space (r 56)` `a change to the work, plant or system of work is about to be made` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must my employer review its controls` `work in a confined space (r 56)` `an incident to which Part 5 of the Act applies happened` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must my employer review its controls` `construction work (r 325)` `an incident to which Part 5 of the Act applies happened` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must my employer review its controls` `construction work (r 325)` `new or additional information about the hazard has become available` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must my employer review its controls` `a hazardous substance (r 163)` `health monitoring identified adverse health effects` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must my employer review its controls` `lead (r 184)` `a worker was removed from lead-risk work` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must my employer review its controls` `lead (r 184)` `a change to the work, plant or system of work is about to be made` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must my employer review its controls` `asbestos at the workplace (r 238)` `new or additional information about the hazard has become available` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must my employer review its controls` `a fall of more than 2 metres (r 44)` `a health and safety representative asked for a review` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must my employer review its controls` `a fall of more than 2 metres (r 44)` `none of these` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must my employer review its controls` `plant (r 98)` `the controls do not adequately control the risk` EQUALS NOTHING

-- r 5 hazardous manual handling. Inputs: force, (a) kinds, (b) live, (c) unstable load.
#ASSERT `Is my work hazardous manual handling` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Is my work hazardous manual handling` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Is my work hazardous manual handling` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT `Is my work hazardous manual handling` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `Is my work hazardous manual handling` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE
-- r 5 musculoskeletal disorder.
#ASSERT `Is my injury a musculoskeletal disorder` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Is my injury a musculoskeletal disorder` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Is my injury a musculoskeletal disorder` FALSE FALSE)
-- rr 26, 27. Inputs: the four r 5 facts, identified, measure, best, reduced.
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached the manual handling duties` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE `information, instruction or training` `mechanical aids` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached the manual handling duties` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `mechanical aids` `mechanical aids` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached the manual handling duties` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE `no measure` `mechanical aids` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached the manual handling duties` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE `mechanical aids` `mechanical aids` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached the manual handling duties` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE `eliminating the risk` `eliminating the risk` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- r 5 noise exposure standard: above 85 dB(A) or above 140 dB(C); the figures themselves do not exceed it.
#ASSERT NOT (`Is my noise exposure above the standard` 85 140)
#ASSERT `Is my noise exposure above the standard` 85.1 100
#ASSERT `Is my noise exposure above the standard` 80 140.5
#ASSERT NOT (`Is my noise exposure above the standard` 84 139)
-- r 32.
#ASSERT `Must my employer measure my noise exposure` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must my employer measure my noise exposure` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- r 34. Inputs: still above with protectors, measure, best, reduced.
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached the noise control duty` TRUE `engineering controls` `engineering controls` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached the noise control duty` FALSE `personal protective equipment, including hearing protectors` `engineering controls` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached the noise control duty` FALSE `personal protective equipment, including hearing protectors` `personal protective equipment, including hearing protectors` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- r 37.
#ASSERT `Must I be given audiometric tests` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must I be given audiometric tests` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- r 37(a): within 3 months; 30 November + 3 months is 28 February (short month).
#ASSERT DATE_SERIAL (`By when must my first audiometric test be done` (`on` 30 11 2025)) EQUALS `day` 28 2 2026
#ASSERT DATE_SERIAL (`By when must my first audiometric test be done` (`on` 15 1 2026)) EQUALS `day` 15 4 2026
-- r 37(c): at least every 2 years; 29 February + 24 months is 28 February.
#ASSERT DATE_SERIAL (`By when is my next audiometric test due` (`on` 29 2 2024)) EQUALS `day` 28 2 2026
#ASSERT DATE_SERIAL (`By when is my next audiometric test due` (`on` 10 3 2025)) EQUALS `day` 10 3 2027
-- r 38. Inputs: falls at 3000, 4000, 6000 Hz, earlier test, later test. 15 dB is enough ("equal to or greater");
-- tests exactly 2 years apart are within "a period not exceeding 2 years"; a day more is not.
#ASSERT `Must I be sent for an audiological examination` 15 0 0 (`on` 1 1 2024) (`on` 1 1 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must I be sent for an audiological examination` 14 14 14 (`on` 1 1 2024) (`on` 1 1 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must I be sent for an audiological examination` 0 0 20 (`on` 1 1 2024) (`on` 2 1 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must I be sent for an audiological examination` 0 15 0 (`on` 1 6 2025) (`on` 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- r 40(1): "while the employee is employed".
#ASSERT `Must my employer still keep my hearing test results` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must my employer still keep my hearing test results` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- r 41 and r 5 "fall": more than 2 metres; the exclusions.
#ASSERT `Does the falls Part apply to my task` 2 FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does the falls Part apply to my task` 2.1 FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does the falls Part apply to my task` 6 TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does the falls Part apply to my task` 6 FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does the falls Part apply to my task` 6 FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- rr 44, 45. Inputs: height, three exclusions, measure, best, reduced, ladder fit and set up.
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached the fall control duty` 6 FALSE FALSE FALSE `a ladder` `a fall arrest system` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached the fall control duty` 6 FALSE FALSE FALSE `a ladder` `a ladder` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached the fall control duty` 6 FALSE FALSE FALSE `a ladder` `administrative controls` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached the fall control duty` 6 FALSE FALSE FALSE `a passive fall prevention device` `a passive fall prevention device` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached the fall control duty` 6 FALSE FALSE FALSE `a work positioning system` `a passive fall prevention device` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Has my employer breached the fall control duty` 1.5 FALSE FALSE FALSE `no measure` `a passive fall prevention device` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- r 49: only where a measure under r 44(2)-(5) is used.
#ASSERT `Must fall rescue procedures be in place before I start` `a passive fall prevention device` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must fall rescue procedures be in place before I start` `administrative controls` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must fall rescue procedures be in place before I start` `eliminating the risk` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must fall rescue procedures be in place before I start` `personal protective equipment, including hearing protectors` EQUALS NOTHING

-- r 5 confined space. Inputs: kind of structure, entered, restricted, normal pressure, contaminant, oxygen, engulfment, mine.
#ASSERT `Is this a confined space` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Is this a confined space` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Is this a confined space` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Is this a confined space` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `Is this a confined space` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE
-- r 5 safe oxygen level: 19.5% to 23.5% inclusive.
#ASSERT `Is the oxygen level safe` 19.5
#ASSERT NOT (`Is the oxygen level safe` 19.4)
#ASSERT `Is the oxygen level safe` 23.5
#ASSERT NOT (`Is the oxygen level safe` 23.6)
#ASSERT `Is the oxygen level safe` 20.9
-- r 60. Inputs: % of LEL, continuous detector in use.
#ASSERT `Must I be got out of the confined space now` 4.9 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must I be got out of the confined space now` 5 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Must I be got out of the confined space now` 5 TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must I be got out of the confined space now` 9.9 TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Must I be got out of the confined space now` 10 TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- r 63 (and r 50). Inputs: entered, permit naming me, emergency service rescue.
#ASSERT `Was I let into the confined space without a permit` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Was I let into the confined space without a permit` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was I let into the confined space without a permit` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was I let into the confined space without a permit` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- rr 58, 65-67, 69, 73 (and r 50).
#ASSERT `Has my employer broken the confined space working rules` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Has my employer broken the confined space working rules` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Has my employer broken the confined space working rules` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Has my employer broken the confined space working rules` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- r 64: until the work is completed; 2 years after a notifiable incident (29 February + 24 months is 28 February).
#ASSERT DATE_SERIAL (`Until when must the entry permit be kept` (`on` 10 3 2026) FALSE (`on` 1 1 2026)) EQUALS `day` 10 3 2026
#ASSERT DATE_SERIAL (`Until when must the entry permit be kept` (`on` 10 3 2026) TRUE (`on` 15 2 2026)) EQUALS `day` 15 2 2028
#ASSERT DATE_SERIAL (`Until when must the entry permit be kept` (`on` 10 3 2024) TRUE (`on` 29 2 2024)) EQUALS `day` 28 2 2026

-- r 74. Inputs: kind, manual or hand-supported.
#ASSERT `Does the plant Part apply to this plant` `plant that processes material by mechanical action (r 74(1)(a))` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does the plant Part apply to this plant` `plant that processes material by mechanical action (r 74(1)(a))` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does the plant Part apply to this plant` `a laser` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does the plant Part apply to this plant` `a ship, boat or aircraft` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Does the plant Part apply to this plant` `other plant` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Does the plant Part apply to this plant` `a road or rail vehicle used at a workplace off public roads and rail` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does the plant Part apply to this plant` `a road or rail vehicle on a public road or rail` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- r 124: r 74(1)(b)-(e), (g)-(k) only.
#ASSERT `Is the plant prescribed plant for incident notification` `plant that lifts or moves persons or materials (r 74(1)(b))` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is the plant prescribed plant for incident notification` `plant that lifts or moves persons or materials (r 74(1)(b))` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is the plant prescribed plant for incident notification` `plant that processes material by mechanical action (r 74(1)(a))` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is the plant prescribed plant for incident notification` `a laser` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is the plant prescribed plant for incident notification` `a scaffold` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is the plant prescribed plant for incident notification` `an amusement structure` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is the plant prescribed plant for incident notification` `a tractor` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is the plant prescribed plant for incident notification` `pressure equipment` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is the plant prescribed plant for incident notification` `other plant` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- r 74(4): a road vehicle used at a workplace off public roads is within Division 5, where r 124 sits.
