#ASSERT `Is the plant prescribed plant for incident notification` `a road or rail vehicle on a public road or rail` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- r 99(3). Inputs: used, best reasonably practicable, access needed.
#ASSERT `Was the guarding the wrong kind` `a permanently fixed physical barrier` `a permanently fixed physical barrier` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was the guarding the wrong kind` `a physical barrier removable only with tools` `a permanently fixed physical barrier` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Was the guarding the wrong kind` `a permanently fixed physical barrier` `an interlocked physical barrier` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Was the guarding the wrong kind` `an interlocked physical barrier` `an interlocked physical barrier` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was the guarding the wrong kind` `a presence-sensing safeguarding system` `a physical barrier removable only with tools` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Was the guarding the wrong kind` `no guarding` `a permanently fixed physical barrier` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was the guarding the wrong kind` `a physical barrier removable only with tools` `a permanently fixed physical barrier` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Penalties (r 7; the Act's ss 21, 22(1); each provision's own penalty).
#ASSERT `What is the most the employer can be fined` `r 34 controlling noise exposure` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 1800
#ASSERT `What is the most the employer can be fined` `r 34 controlling noise exposure` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 9000
#ASSERT `What is the most the employer can be fined` `r 37 audiometric testing` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 240
#ASSERT `What is the most the employer can be fined` `r 37 audiometric testing` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 1200
#ASSERT `What is the most the employer can be fined` `r 20 confidentiality of health monitoring reports and copy to the person` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 500
#ASSERT `What is the most the employer can be fined` `r 45 ladders` `a natural person` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `What is the most the employer can be fined` `r 205 no eating, drinking or smoking in lead areas (employee)` `a natural person` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `What is the most the employer can be fined` `r 205 no eating, drinking or smoking in lead areas (employee)` `a body corporate` EQUALS NOTHING
-- r 205 is the employee's own offence: 100 penalty units, asked from the worker's seat.
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined` `r 205 no eating, drinking or smoking in lead areas (employee)` EQUALS JUST 100
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined` `r 190(1) no eating, drinking or smoking in lead areas (employer)` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `What is the most the employer can be fined` `r 182 lead information to job applicants` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 5
#ASSERT `What is the most the employer can be fined` `r 182 lead information to job applicants` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 25
#ASSERT `What is the most the employer can be fined` `r 218-224 asbestos prohibitions` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 400
#ASSERT `What is the most the employer can be fined` `r 355 notice of construction excavation` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 300
#ASSERT `What is the most the employer can be fined` `r 319Y engineered stone benchtops, panels and slabs` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 100
#ASSERT `What is the most the employer can be fined` `r 341 construction induction card` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 500
#ASSERT `What is the most the employer can be fined` `r 325 controlling construction risks` `a natural person` EQUALS JUST 1800
#ASSERT `What is the most the employer can be fined` `r 200 medical examination after removal` `a body corporate` EQUALS JUST 1200
#ASSERT `Is the breach a breach of the Act` `r 34 controlling noise exposure` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is the breach a breach of the Act` `r 37 audiometric testing` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is the breach a breach of the Act` `r 355 notice of construction excavation` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is the breach a breach of the Act` `r 205 no eating, drinking or smoking in lead areas (employee)` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is the breach a breach of the Act` `r 45 ladders` EQUALS NOTHING
